 "messages": [
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_2b57f8c6",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_3f81d6b5",
   "sender_id": "u_mhuang27_a888f5",
   "text": "ok weird request from the 3am feed club 😅 i need audiobooks. something that keeps me awake but isn't sad. you're the book club one",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-09-15T08:12:38.715000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_d94a1e30",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_3f81d6b5",
   "sender_id": "ms_user_grace",
   "text": "Not weird at all! The God of the Woods is a total page turner, and North Woods if you want something beautiful. Skip The Great Believers for now, it's gorgeous but it'll wreck you at 3am ❤️",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-09-15T12:05:13.290000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_5c3e07f9",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_3f81d6b5",
   "sender_id": "u_mhuang27_a888f5",
   "text": "god of the woods downloaded. theo says thank you (he did not say that, he spit up on me)",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-09-15T14:08:47.651000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_a8f61d2e",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_3f81d6b5",
   "sender_id": "ms_user_grace",
   "text": "Ha! Tell Theo he's welcome anyway 😊 Sending you all some sleep ❤️",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-09-15T14:20:05.884000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_2f7c4e1a",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6b3e0a9d",
   "sender_id": "contact_9bc5252d5b4502a5ab351791",
   "text": "Hi Grace, Dad's message last night about a room made me laugh. Your father has never booked a room in his life! Is he up to something? Love, Mom 😊",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-10-21T17:20:14.318000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_a90d63b5",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6b3e0a9d",
   "sender_id": "ms_user_grace",
   "text": "No, I think he just wants somewhere quiet where we can all hear each other 😊 It will be a lovely dinner for your last day ❤️",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-10-21T17:47:38.902000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_5e1b8c72",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6b3e0a9d",
   "sender_id": "contact_9bc5252d5b4502a5ab351791",
   "text": "Okay! I'm looking forward to it. Love, Mom ❤️",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-10-21T18:02:51.457000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_6e2a9f14",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_9a4c27e1",
   "sender_id": "ms_user_grace",
   "text": "Hi Frank! Is the snow thrower still available?",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:40:17.204000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_b30c7d58",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_9a4c27e1",
   "sender_id": "u_frank_kowalczyk43_c97eac",
   "text": "Hi Grace, yes it is. Still runs like new.",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-10-24T22:02:44.861000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_4d91e6a2",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_9a4c27e1",
   "sender_id": "ms_user_grace",
   "text": "Great. It would be for my parents' driveway in Naperville, not our building. Would the cord reach if the outlet is in the garage?",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-10-24T22:10:09.537000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_e87b2c03",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_9a4c27e1",
   "sender_id": "u_frank_kowalczyk43_c97eac",
   "text": "The 50 ft cord gets you to the end of most driveways. It's fine on a few inches of snow, but I wouldn't count on it for the heavy wet stuff.",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-10-24T22:15:52.118000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_19f5a0bd",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_9a4c27e1",
   "sender_id": "ms_user_grace",
   "text": "Good to know, thank you! Let me ask my dad, he'll want to measure first 😊",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-10-24T22:18:31.476000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_c6d82e47",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_9a4c27e1",
   "sender_id": "ms_user_grace",
   "text": "Hi Frank, my dad says he'd rather keep shoveling for one more winter. Sorry, and thanks for answering all my questions!",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-10-26T17:20:26.903000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_7a0e4b91",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_9a4c27e1",
   "sender_id": "u_frank_kowalczyk43_c97eac",
   "text": "No problem at all. Tell him to lift with his legs 👍",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-10-26T17:41:58.342000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_0c5e9a21",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6b3e0a9d",
   "sender_id": "contact_9bc5252d5b4502a5ab351791",
   "text": "Hi Grace, Dad says your race is this Saturday morning. What time do you start? Please dress warm, it gets windy by the lake in November. Love, Mom 😊",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:10:42.318000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_7b3f1d84",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6b3e0a9d",
   "sender_id": "ms_user_grace",
   "text": "Hi Mom! Yes, Saturday at 7:30 at Montrose Harbor. I'll wear layers and toss the extra one at the start, promise 😊",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:26:15.904000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_e29a6c05",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6b3e0a9d",
   "sender_id": "contact_9bc5252d5b4502a5ab351791",
   "text": "Good. Are you nervous? You have been working so hard this fall.",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:29:03.127000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_5d1b8f3e",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_6b3e0a9d",
   "sender_id": "ms_user_grace",
   "text": "A little! Mostly excited. Jess is running it too and we're getting brunch after. I'll send you a picture from the finish ❤️",
   "attachments": [],
   "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:37:50.661000Z",
   "unsent_at": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ms_msg_a84c2e97",
